A||N||11||Bald Dude||Any opinions on Design One Northstar conversion?||||5||
Z||000000||Bald Dude||10-28-2000||10:43 PM||||Well,  Anyone done one?  I keep hearing about the Archie conversion but nothing about Design One.  I am going to do a V-8 conversion and am looking for opinions on both.  <P>I like the idea of the Northstar with a 4 speed auto connected to a smog-legal motor.  <P>I plan to put it all into a chassis with a Finale body so I'll be dealing with Archie anyway.  <P>Let me know what you think!<P>Thanks,<P>Mark<p>[This message has been edited by Bald Dude (edited 10-28-2000).]||||reg||5
